      «library file: |.subckt HBdriver s sd +gt -gt +gb -gb\n¥1 N01 0 out ¥ N02 sf N01 ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ulator space=fmin mark=fmax\nV1 N01 0 2\nV3 N02 0 1\nB1 fm 0 V=V(out)-1\nR1 s 0 10Meg\nB2 sf 0 V=if(V(s)>=0, if(V(s)<=1, V(s), 1), 0)\nB3 sq 0 V=if(V(rfm)>pi*dt, 1, 0)\nB4 +gt -gt V=if( V(sd)<0.1, if(V(fm)>0, Vcc*V(sq), 0), 0)\nB5 +gb -gb V=if( V(sd)<0.1, if(V(fm)<0, Vcc*V(sq), 0), 0 )\nB6 rfm 0 V=abs(V(fm))\nR2 sd 0 10Meg\n.ends HBdriver»
